">Toothpaste RDA Table</a></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/toothpaste-chart\">Toothpaste Chart</a></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/ph-and-acidity-of-food-beverages\">PH and Acidity of Food &amp; Beverages</a></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/special-offers\">Special Offers</a></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/virtual-consultation\">Virtual Consultation</a></li></ul></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/financing\">Financing</a></li><li class=\"navbar_item\"><a class=\"navbar_link\" href=\"/contacts\">Contacts</a></li></ul></nav>\n      <div class=\"navbar_actions\">\n        <a class=\"navbar_phone\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\">(281) 769-8878</a>\n        <a class=\"button is-slate\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule Online</a>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"navbar_toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navbar-menu\" aria-label=\"Menu\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n</header>\n<button class=\"navbar_scrim\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></button>\n<main class=\"main-wrapper\" id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"section_hero\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-small\"><div class=\"hero_media\"><img src=\"/uploads/CnnPetxJ3dBcNdDm5qgY8-g7-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"The team at Mason Park Dental of Katy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_intro\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"layout-split is-text-wide\">\n    <div><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">Dentist in Katy, TX</p>\n       <h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\">Experience Exceptional Dentistry at Mason Park Dental of Katy</h1>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"text-size-regular\">We have an ongoing commitment to continuing education. Our team invests countless hours in learning the latest techniques and technologies in dentistry. At Mason Park Dental, you will benefit from our state-of-the-art facilities.</p><div class=\"spacer-xsmall\"></div><p class=\"text-size-regular\">We use accurate, efficient, and modern equipment to ensure your comfort at all times. Some of our advanced dental technologies include Cone Beam Imaging, Digital X-Rays, Intral-Oral Camera, and Soft Tissue Laser. Visit our Technology page for more information.</p>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <div class=\"button-group\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/our-services\">Learn more</a><a class=\"button is-ghost\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule online</a></div></div>\n    <div><img src=\"/uploads/ogHJ_nWLPlAhHweErW0U_-Action-11-scaled-qiktqxydtvunmvibkioopgss35dwlv0ng9x8zckzys.jpg\" alt=\"A patient in consultation at Mason Park Dental of Katy\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_services background-color-paper\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading_component is-centered\"><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">What we do</p><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Dentistry for every stage of life</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"layout-grid is-4col\"><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/cosmetic-dentistry\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/iLKt80O_25zpAyCN5xWM7-s4.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Cosmetic Dentistry</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/sedation-dentistry\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/aR9xH2QMbKBGywaI28CY4-s3.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Sedation Dentistry</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/technology\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/Jf1vN7ogTT45Rxy-09Eql-s2.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Advanced Technology</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/comprehensive-care\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/1lE_HF-xKrqFo9IB50Oev-s1.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Comprehensive Care</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/invisalign\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/_XdtJGmPYrf7zpOEQ0u53-s12.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Invisalign</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/pediatric-dental-care\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/ho8bOaynLeIxXtY020gx--s11.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Pediatric Dental Care</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/dentures\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/PxnZ9MFRLk0yvBOvz2aDw-s10.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Dentures</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/oral-surgery\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/GFdaozlP_Acgg4TfNpGoa-s9.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Oral Surgery</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/extractions\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/XHfz7MCN4B4pQwGSQfsUN-s8.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Extractions</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/root-canal-therapy\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/yIgGRIDCr6AfL55Qp8sp_-s7.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Root Canal Therapy</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/preventative-dentistry\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/WPgCjTFe34qaGdfo4weYW-s6.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Preventative Dentistry</h3>\n  </a><a class=\"card_component is-link\" href=\"/services/dental-implant-placement\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/xhnCPNE9gMzmMImza9kgc-s5.webp\" class=\"service-card_icon\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Dental Implants</h3>\n  </a></div>\n      <div class=\"spacer-xlarge\"></div>\n      <div class=\"layout-split is-text-wide\">\n    <div><p class=\"text-size-regular\">You are important to us. For your convenience, we provide a wide range of dental solutions in our local Katy location. Some of these options include preventative, restorative, and cosmetic dentistry.</p><div class=\"spacer-xsmall\"></div><p class=\"text-size-regular\">Our friendly, knowledgeable team will address every question and concern. Your oral health needs, goals, and priorities are the focus of your customized treatment plan. We want to work with you to create the beautiful, healthy smile of your dreams. With our advanced technology, our team will provide you with the most comfortable and comprehensive treatment specific to your needs.</p></div>\n    <div><div class=\"text-align-center\">\n           <a class=\"button is-secondary\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request an appointment</a>\n           <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n           <p class=\"card_meta\">Or call <a href=\"tel:+12817698878\">(281) 769-8878</a></p>\n         </div></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_doctors-intro\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"layout-split\">\n    <div><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">Dentist in Katy, TX</p>\n       <h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Meet Our Esteemed Dentists</h2>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"text-size-regular\">Dr. Sung, Dr. Cho, and Dr. Nguyen, Katy dentists, are committed to providing you with excellent dentistry in a comfortable environment. You deserve a skilled, experienced dental team that can help you ensure great oral health.</p><div class=\"spacer-xsmall\"></div><p class=\"text-size-regular\">Your dental care experience is fully personalized at Mason Park Dental. Our friendly, knowledgeable team will address every question and concern. Your oral health needs, goals, and priorities are the focus of your customized treatment plan. We want to work with you to create the beautiful, healthy smile of your dreams.</p><div class=\"spacer-xsmall\"></div><p class=\"text-size-regular\">Come experience what patient-centered care can do for you. We welcome new patients of all ages.</p>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <a class=\"button\" href=\"/our-team\">Meet our team</a></div>\n    <div><img src=\"/uploads/sJnhTX_X7LXyp8oeyHHJO-Doctors-qiktq1zvdimwo4sqr4vdcov3w1rfc5hrzvqqnxwduc.jpg\" alt=\"Two of the dentists at Mason Park Dental of Katy\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_virtual-consult background-color-ink\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"layout-split\">\n    <div><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">GET A FREE VIRTUAL DENTAL CONSULT</h2>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"text-size-regular\">Skip taking off work for that awkward in-office consult. Get a free Virtual Consult in three easy steps.</p>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <a class=\"button\" href=\"/virtual-consultation\">Virtual consultation</a></div>\n    <div><div class=\"layout-grid is-3col step-list_component\">\n    <div class=\"card_component step-card_component\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Snap Some Photos Of Your Smile</h3></div><div class=\"card_component step-card_component\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Write A Quick Message About Your Smile</h3></div><div class=\"card_component step-card_component\"><h3 class=\"heading-style-h4\">Get A Video Response From The Doctor</h3></div>\n  </div></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_financing background-color-paper\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"layout-split\">\n    <div><img src=\"/uploads/Cd_MAKHRd_eRdK1tvbrby-68252146834983973a92051f_cherry-logo-primary.svg\" alt=\"Cherry\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Cherry Dental Financing: 0% APR with no hard credit check</h2>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"text-size-regular\">Buy Now. Pay Monthly. Let your money go further and take better control of your finances when you pay in installments with Cherry financing.</p>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <a class=\"button\" href=\"/financing\">See financing options</a>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"card_meta\">Applications are handled by Cherry. Ask the front desk which account your application should go through.</p></div>\n    <div><img src=\"/uploads/3vjjr-fwf92f_LinEy4jV-WhatsApp_Image_2025-01-14_at_20_55_54-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"Two patients reviewing financing options on a tablet\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_doctors\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading_component is-centered\"><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">Dentist in Katy, TX</p><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Meet the dental team</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"layout-grid is-3col\"><a class=\"doctor-card_component\" href=\"/team/dr-cho\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/WU3-XjAwi47Wbc7SMAvEl-HS-7-scaled.jpg\" class=\"doctor-card_image\" alt=\"Dr. Dave Cho\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"doctor-card_name heading-style-h4\">Dr. Dave Cho</h3>\n    <p class=\"doctor-card_role\">General Dentist</p>\n    \n  </a><a class=\"doctor-card_component\" href=\"/team/dr-sung\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/wgs04yD8kPbxbtp5KQUgl-DrWilliamSung-230x300-1.webp\" class=\"doctor-card_image\" alt=\"Dr. William Sung\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"doctor-card_name heading-style-h4\">Dr. William Sung</h3>\n    <p class=\"doctor-card_role\">General Dentist</p>\n    \n  </a><a class=\"doctor-card_component\" href=\"/team/tam-nguyen\">\n    <img src=\"/uploads/_HkmE7g8jYTxOz79OiKcB-HS-8-scaled.jpg\" class=\"doctor-card_image\" alt=\"Dr. Tam Nguyen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <h3 class=\"doctor-card_name heading-style-h4\">Dr. Tam Nguyen</h3>\n    <p class=\"doctor-card_role\">Board Certified Pediatric Dentist</p>\n    \n  </a></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_scheduling background-color-paper\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\"><div class=\"layout-split\">\n    <div><img src=\"/uploads/F_p4wgIlYRp0C5ZyYypYI-Emergency-1.jpg\" alt=\"A team member taking a call at the practice\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n    <div><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">Dentist in Katy, TX</p>\n       <h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Flexible Scheduling and Emergency Care</h2>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <p class=\"text-size-regular\">Your convenience is our priority, which is why we provide flexible scheduling to accommodate your busy life. In case of dental emergencies, we are ready to provide the prompt and efficient care you need.</p>\n       <div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n       <div class=\"button-group\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request an appointment</a><a class=\"button is-ghost\" href=\"/services/emergency-dentist\">Dental emergency?</a></div></div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_reviews background-color-ink\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-large\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading_component is-centered\"><p class=\"text-style-eyebrow\">Reviews</p><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">What people are saying</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"review-list_component\"><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">The team here is so wonderful. Very caring. They made me smile, especially Dr. Sung, Caisy and Nusrat. I really recommend this place. My first time here and I am so loving it. When I came back for my cleaning, Angela and Abigail were super nice</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">Chiaka U</cite>\n  </div><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">I was recommend by another dentist who didn’t accept my insurance anymore. First time experience was amazing, went in for a cleaning with Genevieve and she was amazing. She was very informing and kind with what she was doing. Will continue to keep coming back :)</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">Jocelyne Lara</cite>\n  </div><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">Tiffany was “extremely” informative with regards to providing critical information for my dental care. She kept me informed with everything she was doing and answered all my questions. This was one of the BEST dental experience I’ve had. Thanks for the exceptional services provided!!!! “</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">MD The Cooking Doctor</cite>\n  </div><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">I always have a great experience coming here. I have extensive dental work that Dr. Cho and his team have been rectifying. They try to make it as painless and as comfortable as possible during my visits. I don’t feel the usual fear and anxiety that comes with visiting a dentist. Genevieve is a great dental hygienist. She did a great job with my cleaning. It helps that they all have very comforting voices that puts you, the patient at ease; you might be lulled to sleep. Highly recommend. “</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">Abi O</cite>\n  </div><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">Tiffany was a dream with my 5 year old son! She was a natural with my son and he was so good with her. She has a great personality and makes the experience more of a fun time rather than am actual appointment! Dr Cho the main Dr was soooo good with my son engaged and made him feel safe as they both did I wouldn’t take my son anywhere else. Thank you for amazing customer service and bed side mannor.. you help make a scary experience really fun for kids thanks for that!! “</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">Crystal Hope</cite>\n  </div><div class=\"review-card_component\">\n    <p class=\"review-card_stars\" aria-label=\"Five out of five stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p>\n    <blockquote class=\"review-card_quote\">Everyone there is very nice. They were able to see my son within a day of calling. My son had a horrible experience with an extraction as a little boy and he was nervous to have a tooth pulled again. They made him feel at ease. Afterwards he said he didn’t feel a thing. “</blockquote>\n    <cite class=\"review-card_author\">LeeLee P</cite>\n  </div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_map\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-small\">\n      <div class=\"section-heading_component is-centered\"><h2 class=\"heading-style-h2\">Find us in Katy</h2></div>\n      <div data-embed-slot=\"map\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3463.0585305167815!2d-95.75121988455305!3d29.775949038160515!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x86412740e7dd5def%3A0xfa1ab8c6e696e133!2sMason%20Park%20Dental%20-%20Katy%20Dentist!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1638807674675!5m2!1sen!2sus\" data-embed-height=\"460\"></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<section class=\"section_contact-band background-color-tan\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\">\n    <div class=\"container-large\">\n      <div class=\"padding-section-medium\">\n  <div class=\"info-band_component layout-grid is-2col\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"info-band_title\">Contact Us</h2>\n      <p>Dentist Katy</p>\n      <p>21830 Kingsland Blvd #104A,<br>Katy, TX 77450</p>\n      <p><a href=\"tel:+12817698878\">Call: (281) 769-8878</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"info-band_title\">Office Hours</h2>\n      <p>Monday: 9am - 6pm</p><p>Tuesday: 8am - 5pm</p><p>Wednesday: 9am - 6pm</p><p>Thursday: 8am - 5pm</p><p>Friday: Closed</p><p>Saturday: Closed</p><p>Sunday: Closed</p>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section_accreditations background-color-slate\"><div class=\"badge-strip_component\">\n      <div class=\"badge-strip_item\"><img src=\"/uploads/8u0S8vrM8a3CVD2XGsjsu-aapd.webp\" class=\"badge-strip_logo\" alt=\"American Academy of Pediatric Dentistry\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"badge-strip_item\"><img src=\"/uploads/6qTolhK7DyjPyHbb8Ck6W-abpd-1.webp\" class=\"badge-strip_logo\" alt=\"American Board of Pediatric Dentistry - Board Certified\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"badge-strip_item\"><img src=\"/uploads/y7bNDIjXtBo-HnKnHYogE-agd-1.webp\" class=\"badge-strip_logo\" alt=\"Academy of General Dentistry\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"badge-strip_item\"><img src=\"/uploads/bwNSOslYLnVUcc2Hljg75-kois-1.webp\" class=\"badge-strip_logo\" alt=\"Kois Center\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"badge-strip_item\"><img src=\"/uploads/vuzv1hFEyAzLH8l0-yIWl-ssc-1.webp\" class=\"badge-strip_logo\" alt=\"Seattle Study Club\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n    </div></section>\n<footer class=\"footer_component section_footer\">\n  <div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-l